@startuml
actor User as U
participant CLI
participant discover_commands
participant scaffold_module as Scaffold
participant planning_repo as PlanningRepo
participant markdown_repo as MarkdownRepo

U -> CLI: sirius scaffold-design
CLI -> discover_commands: discover_commands()
discover_commands --> CLI: CommandSpec list
CLI -> Scaffold: load module & call main()
Scaffold -> PlanningRepo: ensure_registry() 
Scaffold -> MarkdownRepo: write README.md / scaffold files
Scaffold --> CLI: exit code
CLI --> U: return status
@enduml
